{
  "song_id": 890,
  "title": "Deep Fried Frenz",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Before we go any further",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AB",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "As you call 'em, they call you when they need something",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Trees for the bluntin', to G's for the frontin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I found a way to get peace of mind for years and left the hell alone",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Turn a deaf ear to the cellular phone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Send me a letter or better, we could see each other in real life",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Just so you could feel me like a steel knife",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "At least so you could see the white of their eyes",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Bright with surprise, once they finish spitting lies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Associates, is your boys, your girls, bitches, niggas, homies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Close, or really don't know me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Mom, dad, comrade, peeps, brothers, sisters, duns, dunnies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Some come around when they need some money",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Others make us laugh like the Sunday funnies",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Fam be around whether you paid or bummy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You could either ignore this advice or take it from me:",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Be too nice and people take you for a dummy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "So nowadays, he ain't so friendly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Actually they wouldn’t even made a worthy enemy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Read the signs: \"No feeding the baboons\"",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Seein' as how they got your back bleeding from the stab wounds",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Y'all know the dance, they smile in your face, y'all know the glance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Try to put 'em on, they blow the chance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Never let your so-called mans know your plans",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "(How many of us have them?) A show of hands",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "(Friends) is a term some people use loosely",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "I'm real choosy on what I choose to let crews see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "You telling me I try to act broke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Jealousy the number one killer among black folk",
          "rhyme": "Olk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Fellas be under some type of spell like crack smoke",
          "rhyme": "ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Ghetto Cinderellas lead 'em right to your stack, loc",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Just another way a chick'll lead to your end",
          "rhyme": "End",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "I checked the dictionary for the meaning of friend",
          "rhyme": ")d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "It said, \"Person one likes to socialize with",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Sympathizer, helper\", and that's about the size of it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Most of the time these attributes is one-sided",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "To bolster the crime, they're apt to shoot you through your eyelid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "And they can't hide it, going wild like a white bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Sometimes you need to cut niggas off like a light switch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "(Flick!) And when things get quiet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Catch 'em like a thief in the night, what a riot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "I first met Mr. Fantastik at an arms deal",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Don't let it get drastic, think of how your moms'll feel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "When it get for real, steel get to sparkin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Everything darken, it ain't no talkin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "For somethin' so cheap, it sure buys a lot of trouble",
          "rhyme": "ubl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "You're better off focusing than tryna plot to bubble",
          "rhyme": "ibl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Or else it'd be a sad note to end on, the guns we got is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "(One's we can depend on, friends)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Some come in the form of co-dependents",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "A lot of times only end up being co-defendants",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Ten bucks say they tell for a lower sentence",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "And leave you up under the jail, begging for repentance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "It don't make no sense, what happened to the loyalty?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "Honor amongst crooks, trust amongst royalty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "I'd rather go out in a blaze than give 'em the glory",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "(How many of us have—) a similar story?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "(Friends) before lovers, we need to have some type of overstanding",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "Just so when I let her get the man thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "She know it's no strings, we could do the damn thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "But ho, it's no rings, just how the tramp swings",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "Will she see him again? That depends on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "\"How good was the skins?\" and \"Could she memorize the lessons?\"",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "It ain't no need to pretend",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "Even though she let him stab it, she know they're just friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEFGGHGIGGHGGGJKLLMMGGNONPQRSSTUVVIWXYZZ[\\I]MMLLGGGGAAAAJJMM",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEEFAAGAFAAGAAAHIJJJJAADCDCFBAAKEAAFDAFAALAFMJJJJAAAAAAAAHHJJ"
    },
    {
