        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "How many of us have them?",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Ones we can depend on?",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "How many of us have them?",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Before we go any further",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABACABAD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACABAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Fellas! Don't be silly! I know who my friends are!",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And the next nice neighborhood I move into, you guys'll get crack'",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(Negro humor always escaped me)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "The most powerful, the most mysterious monarch in all the world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Guarded by a fighting force that never sleeps",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That never relaxes its vigilance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "For none is as feared, none has as many foes as DOOM",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "The awesome armorclad lord of..",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I know who Doom is (Then tell us)",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He happens to be the most dangerous man in the world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I’d hoped we’d never hear from him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Hoped we’d never have to battle him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "But now the worst has happened and I must tell you what we’re up against",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I first met DOOM years ago",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "When he wanted to be alone, alone to pursue his forbidden experiments",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "One day while conducting a secret experiment",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "*Explosion sounds*",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Later, when he recovered from his injuries",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Instead of having learned his lesson, DOOM was bitter, angry, vengeful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "*Woman screams* What have I done to myself?",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "My face, it is hideous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "He traveled the world, seeking a cure for his disfigured face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "(I’m sorry sir, there is nothing we can do for you)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "He traveled through remote villages, where strangers are seldom seen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "He continued his search, never showing his face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Unless threatened by bandits who prey on travelers",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Who foolishly wander alone through their domain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFAGGHIJGKLMNOPQRPST",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAEABBEFCBGBHEDIJBIKL"
    }
  ]
}